  "segments": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "start": 1.84,
      "end": 2.5,
      "en": "Hello, English learners.",
      "zh": "各位英语学习者，大家好。"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "start": 2.84,
      "end": 4.24,
      "en": "Welcome back to EnglishPod.",
      "zh": "欢迎回到 EnglishPod。"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 4.44,
      "end": 4.96,
      "en": "My name is Marco.",
      "zh": "我叫 Marco。"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 5.2,
      "end": 5.68,
      "en": "And I'm Erica.",
      "zh": "我叫 Erica。"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 6.3,
      "end": 10.1,
      "en": "And today we're bringing you another great lesson for all of you who are interested in shopping.",
      "zh": "今天，我们为所有对购物感兴趣的人带来了另一个重要的教训。"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 10.54,
      "end": 14.04,
      "en": "Especially those of you who are interested in shopping for a car.",
      "zh": "尤其是那些有兴趣购买汽车的人。"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 14.36,
      "end": 15.38,
      "en": "A car, exactly.",
      "zh": "一辆车，没错。"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "start": 16.08,
      "end": 19.94,
      "en": "So we're going to give you some great language about describing a car or characteristics of a car.",
      "zh": "因此，我们将为您提供一些关于描述汽车或汽车特性的好语言。"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "start": 20.58,
      "end": 21.58,
      "en": "Yep.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "start": 21.58,
      "end": 24.2,
      "en": "And also some really interesting language for shopping.",
      "zh": "还有一些非常有趣的购物语言。"
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "start": 24.4,
      "end": 27.26,
      "en": "Yes, especially buying something really big and expensive.",
      "zh": "是的，尤其是购买真正大而昂贵的东西。"
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "start": 27.52,
      "end": 28.8,
      "en": "Yeah, like a car.",
      "zh": "是的，就像一辆汽车。"
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "start": 28.8,
      "end": 29.8,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "start": 29.8,
      "end": 34.4,
      "en": "So before we listen to our dialogue, let's take a look at vocabulary preview.",
      "zh": "所以在我们听对话之前，让我们先看看词汇预览。"
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "start": 34.4,
      "end": 34.71,
      "en": "Vocabulary preview.",
      "zh": "词汇预习。"
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "start": 36.08,
      "end": 38.24,
      "en": "On vocabulary preview today, we're bringing you two words.",
      "zh": "在今天的词汇预览中，我们为您带来了两个词。"
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "start": 38.84,
      "end": 40.38,
      "en": "The first one is vehicle.",
      "zh": "第一个是车辆。"
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "start": 41.14,
      "end": 41.58,
      "en": "Vehicle.",
      "zh": "车辆。"
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "start": 41.84,
      "end": 42.84,
      "en": "Vehicle.",
      "zh": "车辆。"
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "start": 43.32,
      "end": 43.5,
      "en": "Vehicle.",
      "zh": "车辆。"
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "start": 44.26,
      "end": 47.34,
      "en": "So, again, a vehicle is a machine, right?",
      "zh": "所以，再一次，一辆车就是一台机器，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "start": 47.6,
      "end": 48.6,
      "en": "Right.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "start": 48.6,
      "end": 51.64,
      "en": "A machine that carries people from one place to another.",
      "zh": "一台机器，将人从一个地方带到另一个地方。"
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "start": 51.64,
      "end": 54.4,
      "en": "So it's important to say that a vehicle could be an airplane.",
      "zh": "因此，重要的是要说一辆车可以是一架飞机。"
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "start": 55.4,
      "end": 55.76,
      "en": "A car.",
      "zh": "一辆车。"
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "start": 56.4,
      "end": 56.54,
      "en": "A car.",
      "zh": "一辆车。"
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "start": 57.4,
      "end": 58.4,
      "en": "A boat.",
      "zh": "一艘船。"
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "start": 58.4,
      "end": 59.4,
      "en": "A boat.",
      "zh": "一艘船。"
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "start": 59.4,
      "end": 61.44,
      "en": "Yeah, that's a vehicle.",
      "zh": "是的，那是一辆车。"
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "start": 61.44,
      "end": 63.31,
      "en": "Our second word is sedan.",
      "zh": "我们的第二个词是轿车。"
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "start": 63.93,
      "end": 64.49,
      "en": "Sedan.",
      "zh": "轿车。"
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "start": 64.87,
      "end": 65.45,
      "en": "Sedan.",
      "zh": "轿车。"
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "start": 65.73,
      "end": 66.33,
      "en": "Sedan.",
      "zh": "轿车。"
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "start": 66.79,
      "end": 69.59,
      "en": "So a sedan is a type of car.",
      "zh": "所以轿车是一种汽车。"
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "start": 69.81,
      "end": 69.99,
      "en": "Exactly.",
      "zh": "正是这样。"
    },
    {
      "id": 36,
      "start": 70.49,
      "end": 74.43,
      "en": "It's a type of car with four doors that can fit five people inside.",
      "zh": "这是一种有四扇门的汽车，可以容纳五个人。"
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "start": 75.13,
      "end": 78.51,
      "en": "So to make it more clear, most taxis are sedans.",
      "zh": "所以更清楚的是，大多数出租车都是轿车。"
    },
    {
      "id": 38,
      "start": 78.75,
      "end": 79.07,
      "en": "Exactly.",
      "zh": "正是这样。"
    },
    {
      "id": 39,
      "start": 79.88,
      "end": 80.88,
      "en": "Right?",
      "zh": "对吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "start": 80.88,
      "end": 84.12,
      "en": "They have four doors, five people can fit in there, including the driver.",
      "zh": "他们有四扇门，五个人可以容纳，包括司机。"
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "start": 84.12,
      "end": 84.93,
      "en": "Except taxis in Mexico.",
      "zh": "墨西哥的出租车除外。"
    },
    {
      "id": 42,
      "start": 85.68,
      "end": 86.25,
      "en": "They're not sedans?",
      "zh": "他们不是轿车？"
    },
    {
      "id": 43,
      "start": 86.68,
      "end": 87.19,
      "en": "They're little beetles.",
      "zh": "他们是小甲虫。"
    },
    {
      "id": 44,
      "start": 87.75,
      "end": 87.93,
      "en": "Oh.",
      "zh": "哦。"
    },
    {
      "id": 45,
      "start": 88.37,
      "end": 89.13,
      "en": "They're Volkswagen beetles.",
      "zh": "它们是大众甲壳虫。"
    },
    {
      "id": 46,
      "start": 89.68,
      "end": 90.68,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 47,
      "start": 90.68,
      "end": 91.68,
      "en": "So those are not sedans.",
      "zh": "所以那些不是轿车。"
    },
    {
      "id": 48,
      "start": 91.68,
      "end": 93.53,
      "en": "But yeah, most countries have sedans as taxis.",
      "zh": "但是，是的，大多数国家都有轿车作为出租车。"
    },
    {
      "id": 49,
      "start": 94.16,
      "end": 98.4,
      "en": "To give you some examples, like a Toyota Corolla or a Toyota Camry is a sedan.",
      "zh": "给你一些例子，比如丰田卡罗拉或丰田凯美瑞是一辆轿车。"
    },
    {
      "id": 50,
      "start": 98.4,
      "end": 98.79,
      "en": "Yeah, yeah.",
      "zh": "对，对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 51,
      "start": 99.4,
      "end": 100.81,
      "en": "Maybe like a Volkswagen Jetta.",
      "zh": "也许就像大众捷达一样。"
    },
    {
      "id": 52,
      "start": 101.21,
      "end": 101.67,
      "en": "Is that a...",
      "zh": "那是一个..."
    },
    {
      "id": 53,
      "start": 101.96,
      "end": 102.19,
      "en": "A Jetta, yeah.",
      "zh": "一个捷达，是的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 54,
      "start": 102.96,
      "end": 103.96,
      "en": "A Jetta is a sedan.",
      "zh": "捷达是轿车。"
    },
    {
      "id": 55,
      "start": 103.96,
      "end": 104.96,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 56,
      "start": 104.96,
      "end": 108.92,
      "en": "Now we can listen to our dialogue, and it's going to be at a normal speed the first time, but you don't have to worry about it.",
      "zh": "现在我们可以听我们的对话，第一次它会以正常的速度，但你不必担心。"
    },
    {
      "id": 57,
      "start": 108.92,
      "end": 111.87,
      "en": "We'll come back and teach you some of the important words from the dialogue.",
      "zh": "我们会回来教你对话中的一些重要词。"
    },
    {
      "id": 58,
      "start": 120.53,
      "end": 121.55,
      "en": "Hi there, can I help you folks?",
      "zh": "您好，有什么能帮您的吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 59,
      "start": 124.14,
      "end": 126.82,
      "en": "I'm just browsing, seeing what's on the lot.",
      "zh": "我就是随便看看，看看车场里有什么。"
    },
    {
      "id": 60,
      "start": 127.22,
      "end": 129.64,
      "en": "My daughter wants a car for her birthday, you know how it is.",
      "zh": "我女儿过生日想要辆车，你懂的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 61,
      "start": 130.24,
      "end": 135.64,
      "en": "Dad, I'm 16 already, and I'm like the only one at school who doesn't have a car.",
      "zh": "爸，我都十六岁了，全校好像只有我还没车。"
    },
    {
      "id": 62,
      "start": 136.12,
      "end": 136.92,
      "en": "She's right, you know.",
      "zh": "你知道，她说得对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 63,
      "start": 137.34,
      "end": 138.48,
      "en": "Kids these days all have cars.",
      "zh": "现在的孩子们都有车。"
    },
    {
      "id": 64,
      "start": 139.08,
      "end": 143.38,
      "en": "Let me show you something we just got in, a 1996 sedan, excellent gas mileage.",
      "zh": "给您看看我们刚到的一辆1996年的轿车，特别省油。"
    },
    {
      "id": 65,
      "start": 143.92,
      "end": 147.92,
      "en": "It has dual airbags and anti-lock brakes, a perfect vehicle for a young driver.",
      "zh": "配备双安全气囊和防抱死刹车，很适合年轻司机。"
    },
    {
      "id": 66,
      "start": 148.16,
      "end": 149.2,
      "en": "Dad, I love it.",
      "zh": "爸爸，我太喜欢了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 67,
      "start": 149.38,
      "end": 149.84,
      "en": "It's awesome.",
      "zh": "太棒了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 68,
      "start": 150.7,
      "end": 151.86,
      "en": "Can we get this one, please?",
      "zh": "我们买这辆好不好？"
    },
    {
      "id": 69,
      "start": 153.26,
      "end": 153.96,
      "en": "I see.",
      "zh": "我明白了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 70,
      "start": 154.6,
      "end": 156.02,
      "en": "What can you tell me about this one?",
      "zh": "这辆车你能介绍一下吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 71,
      "start": 157.41,
      "end": 161.05,
      "en": "Oh, that's just an old World War II tank that we used for TV commercials.",
      "zh": "哦，那只是我们用于电视广告的旧二战坦克。"
    },
    {
      "id": 72,
      "start": 161.84,
      "end": 162.84,
      "en": "Now about this sedan...",
      "zh": "还是说回这辆轿车……"
    },
    {
      "id": 73,
      "start": 162.84,
      "end": 164.52,
      "en": "Whoa, whoa, wait a minute.",
      "zh": "哎，等等！"
    },
    {
      "id": 74,
      "start": 164.52,
      "end": 165.39,
      "en": "Tell me more about this tank.",
      "zh": "告诉我更多关于这个坦克的信息。"
    },
    {
      "id": 75,
      "start": 167.49,
      "end": 171.61,
      "en": "Well, sir, if you are looking for quality and safety, then look no further.",
      "zh": "先生，要说结实和安全，这辆坦克绝对首屈一指。"
    },
    {
      "id": 76,
      "start": 172.28,
      "end": 177.56,
      "en": "Three inches of reinforced steel protect your daughter from short-range missile attacks.",
      "zh": "三英寸厚的加强钢板能保护您女儿免受短程导弹袭击。"
    },
    {
      "id": 77,
      "start": 177.56,
      "end": 180.21,
      "en": "Does the sedan protect her from missile attacks?",
      "zh": "轿车能保护她免受导弹攻击吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 78,
      "start": 180.68,
      "end": 181.03,
      "en": "It does not.",
      "zh": "轿车可不行。"
    },
    {
      "id": 79,
      "start": 181.59,
      "end": 182.65,
      "en": "Well, I don't know.",
      "zh": "嗯，我不知道。"
    },
    {
      "id": 80,
      "start": 183.21,
      "end": 183.99,
      "en": "Let me sleep on it.",
      "zh": "我得再考虑考虑。"
    },
    {
      "id": 81,
      "start": 184.35,
      "end": 186.31,
      "en": "Did I mention the tank is a tank?",
      "zh": "我说过这辆坦克真的是坦克吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 82,
      "start": 186.61,
      "end": 187.19,
      "en": "I'll take it.",
      "zh": "我要这个。"
    },
    {
      "id": 83,
      "start": 187.49,
      "end": 187.83,
      "en": "Dad!",
      "zh": "爸爸！"
    },
    {
      "id": 84,
      "start": 197.56,
      "end": 198.31,
      "en": "I think she's really lucky.",
      "zh": "我觉得她真的很幸运。"
    },
    {
      "id": 85,
      "start": 198.59,
      "end": 198.87,
      "en": "Really?",
      "zh": "真的吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 86,
      "start": 199.21,
      "end": 200.87,
      "en": "She's getting a tank to go to school.",
      "zh": "她要一辆坦克去上学。"
    },
    {
      "id": 87,
      "start": 201.2,
      "end": 202.32,
      "en": "How awesome is that?",
      "zh": "那有多棒？"
    },
    {
      "id": 88,
      "start": 202.33,
      "end": 205.83,
      "en": "I would be so embarrassed if I had to drive to school in a tank.",
      "zh": "如果我不得不开着坦克开车去学校，我会很尴尬。"
    },
    {
      "id": 89,
      "start": 205.84,
      "end": 207.24,
      "en": "It's like the coolest car.",
      "zh": "这就像最酷的汽车。"
    },
    {
      "id": 90,
      "start": 207.24,
      "end": 208.15,
      "en": "Oh, you're such a boy.",
      "zh": "哦，你真是个男孩。"
    },
    {
      "id": 91,
      "start": 209.31,
      "end": 214.75,
      "en": "All right, a surprising ending to a relatively easy shopping day.",
      "zh": "好吧，一个相对轻松的购物日的惊人结局。"
    },
    {
      "id": 92,
      "start": 215.08,
      "end": 216.08,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 93,
      "start": 216.08,
      "end": 219.97,
      "en": "Let's take a look at some language that we saw in our dialogue on Language Takeaway.",
      "zh": "让我们来看看我们在关于语言外卖的对话中看到的一些语言。"
    },
    {
      "id": 94,
      "start": 222.24,
      "end": 222.78,
      "en": "Language Takeaway.",
      "zh": "语言要点。"
    },
    {
      "id": 95,
      "start": 224.56,
      "end": 226.47,
      "en": "We have four words for you today.",
      "zh": "今天我们有四个字给你。"
    },
    {
      "id": 96,
      "start": 226.96,
      "end": 229.83,
      "en": "The first one is gas mileage.",
      "zh": "第一个是油耗。"
    },
    {
      "id": 97,
      "start": 230.75,
      "end": 231.35,
      "en": "Gas mileage.",
      "zh": "油耗。"
    },
    {
      "id": 98,
      "start": 231.89,
      "end": 232.41,
      "en": "Gas mileage.",
      "zh": "油耗。"
    },
    {
      "id": 99,
      "start": 233.23,
      "end": 233.95,
      "en": "Gas mileage.",
      "zh": "油耗。"
    },
    {
      "id": 100,
      "start": 235.11,
      "end": 240.63,
      "en": "So gas mileage is how many miles you can travel on a gallon or liter of gasoline.",
      "zh": "所以油耗是你可以用一加仑或一升汽油行驶多少英里。"
    },
    {
      "id": 101,
      "start": 241.07,
      "end": 241.91,
      "en": "Well, you know what's interesting?",
      "zh": "嗯，你知道什么是有趣的吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 102,
      "start": 241.91,
      "end": 250.99,
      "en": "In some English-speaking countries like Australia, New Zealand, Canada, we use kilometers to measure distance, but we still talk about gas mileage.",
      "zh": "在澳大利亚、新西兰、加拿大等一些英语国家，我们使用公里来衡量距离，但我们仍然在谈论汽油里程。"
    },
    {
      "id": 103,
      "start": 251.52,
      "end": 252.52,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 104,
      "start": 252.52,
      "end": 255.52,
      "en": "I guess you can't say gas kilomileage.",
      "zh": "我猜你不能说汽油千里。"
    },
    {
      "id": 105,
      "start": 255.79,
      "end": 256.03,
      "en": "No.",
      "zh": "不。"
    },
    {
      "id": 106,
      "start": 256.52,
      "end": 257.71,
      "en": "Or something like that.",
      "zh": "或者类似的东西。"
    },
    {
      "id": 107,
      "start": 258.44,
      "end": 266.31,
      "en": "But yeah, it's basically how many kilometers or how many miles you can travel on a tank or on a liter or gallon of gas.",
      "zh": "但是，是的，它基本上是您可以在油箱或一升或一加仑汽油上行驶多少公里或多少英里。"
    },
    {
      "id": 108,
      "start": 267.12,
      "end": 268.12,
      "en": "Exactly.",
      "zh": "正是这样。"
    },
    {
      "id": 109,
      "start": 268.12,
      "end": 269.12,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 110,
