      "id": 225,
      "start": 582.24,
      "end": 583.48,
      "en": "Like to think about it overnight.",
      "zh": "喜欢一夜之间想想。"
    },
    {
      "id": 226,
      "start": 583.88,
      "end": 584.5,
      "en": "To think about it.",
      "zh": "去想它。"
    },
    {
      "id": 227,
      "start": 584.88,
      "end": 585.88,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 228,
      "start": 585.88,
      "end": 586.88,
      "en": "Right.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 229,
      "start": 586.88,
      "end": 588.84,
      "en": "So maybe you want to buy this really expensive car.",
      "zh": "所以也许你想买这辆非常昂贵的汽车。"
    },
    {
      "id": 230,
      "start": 588.84,
      "end": 589.7,
      "en": "But you need to think about it.",
      "zh": "但你需要考虑一下。"
    },
    {
      "id": 231,
      "start": 589.96,
      "end": 590.96,
      "en": "Right.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 232,
      "start": 590.96,
      "end": 591.34,
      "en": "So you'll sleep on it.",
      "zh": "所以你会睡在上面。"
    },
    {
      "id": 233,
      "start": 591.96,
      "end": 592.96,
      "en": "So yeah.",
      "zh": "所以是的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 234,
      "start": 592.96,
      "end": 595.68,
      "en": "You go home, sleep on it, think about it twice, and then make a decision.",
      "zh": "你回家，睡在上面，想一想，然后做出决定。"
    },
    {
      "id": 235,
      "start": 596.28,
      "end": 597.28,
      "en": "Exactly.",
      "zh": "正是这样。"
    },
    {
      "id": 236,
      "start": 597.28,
      "end": 598.52,
      "en": "Okay, great words and great dialogue.",
      "zh": "好的，很棒的文字和很棒的对话。"
    },
    {
      "id": 237,
      "start": 598.86,
      "end": 599.98,
      "en": "Yeah, I love this dialogue.",
      "zh": "是的，我喜欢这个对话。"
    },
    {
      "id": 238,
      "start": 600.28,
      "end": 601.42,
      "en": "Yeah, it's kind of funny.",
      "zh": "是的，这有点好笑。"
    },
    {
      "id": 239,
      "start": 601.88,
      "end": 605.12,
      "en": "So we could listen to it again, and then we'll come back and talk a little bit about it.",
      "zh": "所以我们可以再听一遍，然后我们会回来谈谈它。"
    },
    {
      "id": 240,
      "start": 619.52,
      "end": 620.44,
      "en": "Hi there, can I help you folks?",
      "zh": "您好，有什么能帮您的吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 241,
      "start": 622.95,
      "end": 625.67,
      "en": "I'm just browsing, seeing what's on the lot.",
      "zh": "我就是随便看看，看看车场里有什么。"
    },
    {
      "id": 242,
      "start": 626.13,
      "end": 627.75,
      "en": "My daughter wants a car for her birthday.",
      "zh": "我的女儿想要一辆车作为她的生日。"
    },
    {
      "id": 243,
      "start": 627.96,
      "end": 628.96,
      "en": "You know how it is.",
      "zh": "你知道它是怎么回事。"
    },
    {
      "id": 244,
      "start": 628.96,
      "end": 634.53,
      "en": "Dad, I'm 16 already, and I'm like the only one at school who doesn't have a car.",
      "zh": "爸，我都十六岁了，全校好像只有我还没车。"
    },
    {
      "id": 245,
      "start": 634.97,
      "end": 635.75,
      "en": "She's right, you know.",
      "zh": "你知道，她说得对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 246,
      "start": 636.24,
      "end": 638.08,
      "en": "Kids these days all have cars.",
      "zh": "现在的孩子们都有车。"
    },
    {
      "id": 247,
      "start": 638.08,
      "end": 639.21,
      "en": "Let me show you something we just got in.",
      "zh": "让我给你看我们刚进去的东西。"
    },
    {
      "id": 248,
      "start": 639.28,
      "end": 641.68,
      "en": "A 1996 sedan.",
      "zh": "一辆1996年的轿车。"
    },
    {
      "id": 249,
      "start": 641.68,
      "end": 642.23,
      "en": "Excellent gas mileage.",
      "zh": "非常省油。"
    },
    {
      "id": 250,
      "start": 642.76,
      "end": 644.33,
      "en": "It has dual airbags and anti-lock brakes.",
      "zh": "它有双安全气囊和防抱死制动器。"
    },
    {
      "id": 251,
      "start": 644.85,
      "end": 646.31,
      "en": "A perfect vehicle for a young driver.",
      "zh": "适合年轻司机的完美车辆。"
    },
    {
      "id": 252,
      "start": 647.07,
      "end": 648.07,
      "en": "Dad, I love it.",
      "zh": "爸爸，我太喜欢了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 253,
      "start": 648.23,
      "end": 648.65,
      "en": "It's awesome.",
      "zh": "太棒了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 254,
      "start": 649.49,
      "end": 650.73,
      "en": "Can we get this one, please?",
      "zh": "我们买这辆好不好？"
    },
    {
      "id": 255,
      "start": 651.9,
      "end": 652.88,
      "en": "I see.",
      "zh": "我明白了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 256,
      "start": 653.5,
      "end": 654.9,
      "en": "What can you tell me about this one?",
      "zh": "这辆车你能介绍一下吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 257,
      "start": 655.84,
      "end": 659.88,
      "en": "Oh, that's just an old World War II tank that we used for TV commercials.",
      "zh": "哦，那只是我们用于电视广告的旧二战坦克。"
    },
    {
      "id": 258,
      "start": 660.58,
      "end": 661.38,
      "en": "Now about this sedan.",
      "zh": "现在来说说这辆轿车。"
    },
    {
      "id": 259,
      "start": 661.58,
      "end": 662.74,
      "en": "Whoa, whoa, wait a minute.",
      "zh": "哎，等等！"
    },
    {
      "id": 260,
      "start": 663.18,
      "end": 664.26,
      "en": "Tell me more about this tank.",
      "zh": "告诉我更多关于这个坦克的信息。"
    },
    {
      "id": 261,
      "start": 666.35,
      "end": 670.49,
      "en": "Well, sir, if you are looking for quality and safety, then look no further.",
      "zh": "先生，要说结实和安全，这辆坦克绝对首屈一指。"
    },
    {
      "id": 262,
      "start": 671.17,
      "end": 675.15,
      "en": "Three inches of reinforced steel protect your daughter from short-range missile attacks.",
      "zh": "三英寸厚的加强钢板能保护您女儿免受短程导弹袭击。"
    },
    {
      "id": 263,
      "start": 676.44,
      "end": 679.05,
      "en": "Does the sedan protect her from missile attacks?",
      "zh": "轿车能保护她免受导弹攻击吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 264,
      "start": 679.56,
      "end": 679.89,
      "en": "It does not.",
      "zh": "轿车可不行。"
    },
    {
      "id": 265,
      "start": 680.44,
      "end": 681.5,
      "en": "Well, I don't know.",
      "zh": "嗯，我不知道。"
    },
    {
      "id": 266,
      "start": 682.06,
      "end": 682.84,
      "en": "Let me sleep on it.",
      "zh": "我得再考虑考虑。"
    },
    {
      "id": 267,
      "start": 683.22,
      "end": 685.18,
      "en": "Did I mention the tank is a tank?",
      "zh": "我有没有提到坦克是坦克？"
    },
    {
      "id": 268,
      "start": 685.28,
      "end": 686.06,
      "en": "I'll take it.",
      "zh": "我要这个。"
    },
    {
      "id": 269,
      "start": 688.44,
      "end": 690.84,
      "en": "Dad!",
      "zh": "爸爸！"
    },
    {
      "id": 270,
      "start": 693.49,
      "end": 696.15,
      "en": "So, Marco, have you ever driven a tank?",
      "zh": "那么，马可，你开过坦克吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 271,
      "start": 698.48,
      "end": 701.2,
      "en": "I mean, I know you're in the Army.",
      "zh": "我的意思是，我知道你在军队。"
    },
    {
      "id": 272,
      "start": 701.93,
      "end": 703.25,
      "en": "Yeah, actually I did.",
      "zh": "是的，其实我做到了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 273,
      "start": 703.48,
      "end": 705.29,
      "en": "I did drive a tank before.",
      "zh": "我以前确实开过坦克。"
    },
    {
      "id": 274,
      "start": 705.53,
      "end": 705.85,
      "en": "Really?",
      "zh": "真的吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 275,
      "start": 706.84,
      "end": 707.84,
      "en": "Yeah, really old one.",
      "zh": "是的，真的很老一。"
    },
    {
      "id": 276,
      "start": 707.84,
      "end": 709.32,
      "en": "Kind of like a World War II type tank.",
      "zh": "有点像二战型坦克。"
    },
    {
      "id": 277,
      "start": 709.32,
      "end": 711.52,
      "en": "But yeah, they're really fun and interesting.",
      "zh": "但是，是的，它们真的很有趣也很有趣。"
    },
    {
      "id": 278,
      "start": 711.52,
      "end": 712.77,
      "en": "It's not like driving a normal car.",
      "zh": "这不像驾驶普通汽车。"
    },
    {
      "id": 279,
      "start": 713.0,
      "end": 714.0,
      "en": "You have pedals.",
      "zh": "你有踏板。"
    },
    {
      "id": 280,
      "start": 714.0,
      "end": 715.36,
      "en": "So there's no steering wheel?",
      "zh": "所以没有方向盘？"
    },
    {
      "id": 281,
      "start": 715.36,
      "end": 716.36,
      "en": "No, no, no.",
      "zh": "不，不，不。"
    },
    {
      "id": 282,
      "start": 716.36,
      "end": 718.48,
      "en": "You have levers.",
      "zh": "你有杠杆。"
    },
    {
      "id": 283,
      "start": 718.48,
      "end": 723.52,
      "en": "And what many people don't know is that actually tanks are manual transmissions.",
      "zh": "许多人不知道的是，坦克实际上是手动变速箱。"
    },
    {
      "id": 284,
      "start": 723.52,
      "end": 724.68,
      "en": "You have to change gears.",
      "zh": "你必须换档。"
    },
    {
      "id": 285,
      "start": 724.87,
      "end": 725.68,
      "en": "Oh, really?",
      "zh": "哦，真的吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 286,
      "start": 725.85,
      "end": 727.99,
      "en": "And it's really hard to change gears on those things.",
      "zh": "改变这些东西真的很难。"
    },
    {
      "id": 287,
      "start": 728.28,
      "end": 729.91,
      "en": "And what's the gas mileage like in a tank?",
      "zh": "油箱里的油耗是多少？"
    },
    {
      "id": 288,
      "start": 730.96,
      "end": 731.96,
      "en": "I don't know.",
      "zh": "我不知道。"
    },
    {
      "id": 289,
      "start": 731.96,
      "end": 733.27,
      "en": "Maybe like five miles per gallon.",
      "zh": "也许每加仑五英里。"
    },
    {
      "id": 290,
      "start": 733.93,
      "end": 736.87,
      "en": "They run on diesel, which is a different type of fuel, right?",
      "zh": "他们用柴油运行，这是一种不同类型的燃料，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 291,
      "start": 737.08,
      "end": 738.08,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 292,
      "start": 738.08,
      "end": 739.08,
      "en": "Okay, well, very cool.",
      "zh": "好吧，很酷。"
    },
    {
      "id": 293,
      "start": 739.08,
      "end": 741.97,
      "en": "I never knew that my podcast partner had driven a tank.",
      "zh": "我从来不知道我的播客伙伴开过一辆坦克。"
    },
    {
      "id": 294,
      "start": 742.28,
      "end": 742.79,
      "en": "That's pretty awesome.",
      "zh": "那真是太棒了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 295,
      "start": 743.28,
      "end": 744.83,
      "en": "Yeah, well, it was fun, definitely.",
      "zh": "是的，嗯，这很有趣，当然。"
    },
    {
      "id": 296,
      "start": 745.28,
      "end": 746.85,
      "en": "And I hope I get to do it again someday.",
      "zh": "我希望有一天我能再做一次。"
    },
    {
      "id": 297,
      "start": 747.56,
      "end": 748.76,
      "en": "All right.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 298,
      "start": 748.76,
      "end": 751.25,
      "en": "Well, guys, have you ever driven a tank?",
      "zh": "好吧，伙计们，你开过坦克吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 299,
      "start": 752.08,
      "end": 755.24,
      "en": "Or a submarine or any type of armored vehicle?",
      "zh": "还是潜艇或任何类型的装甲车？"
    },
    {
      "id": 300,
      "start": 755.48,
      "end": 756.48,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 301,
      "start": 756.48,
      "end": 758.88,
      "en": "You can find out more about it at our website, EnglishPod.com.",
      "zh": "您可以在我们的网站 englishpod.com 上了解有关它的更多信息。"
    },
    {
      "id": 302,
      "start": 759.48,
      "end": 759.9,
      "en": "Right.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 303,
      "start": 760.02,
      "end": 761.66,
      "en": "We'll be there to answer all your questions.",
      "zh": "我们将在那里回答您的所有问题。"
    },
    {
      "id": 304,
      "start": 762.08,
      "end": 764.86,
      "en": "I'll also be there to maybe post some more crazy stories.",
      "zh": "我也会在那里发布一些更疯狂的故事。"
    },
    {
      "id": 305,
      "start": 765.32,
      "end": 766.36,
      "en": "Or some pictures of a tank.",
      "zh": "或者一些坦克的照片。"
    },
    {
      "id": 306,
      "start": 766.72,
      "end": 767.72,
      "en": "Yeah, maybe.",
      "zh": "对，也许吧。"
    },
    {
      "id": 307,
      "start": 767.72,
      "end": 768.72,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 308,
      "start": 768.72,
      "end": 769.72,
      "en": "All right, guys.",
      "zh": "好了，各位。"
    },
    {
      "id": 309,
      "start": 769.72,
      "end": 770.72,
      "en": "We'll see you there.",
      "zh": "到时候见。"
    },
    {
      "id": 310,
      "start": 770.72,
      "end": 771.72,
      "en": "Until then, it's goodbye.",
      "zh": "那我们下次再见。"
    },
    {
      "id": 311,
      "start": 771.72,
      "end": 777.979,
      "en": "Bye.",
      "zh": "再见。"
    }
  ],
